# Venue drawings & map

- Full workflow and rules: `tools/venue-drawings/README.md` (checklist "a new production appears").
- Venue data lives in `data/venues.json` (hand-maintained). Never add venue fields to `data/shows.json` – the scraper overwrites it daily.
- Drawings are generated (`venue_drawings.py`), never traced from seat-map graphics or photos.
- After adding/changing a venue's `lat`/`lon`, run `python3 tools/venue-drawings/venue_map.py`.
- Check the actual venue on the ticket page (a theatre often has several stages).
